 data-id="Testimonials-2" id="Testimonials-2" class="c-PJLV c-bXbWpx c-bXbWpx-bZJlhX-direction-column c-bXbWpx-joJbDg-align-center c-bXbWpx-idNcPHZ-css"><div class="c-PJLV c-bXbWpx c-bXbWpx-bZJlhX-direction-column c-bXbWpx-ilkBNdM-css"><span class="c-kkmdlQ c-kkmdlQ-jxPRpY-structure-subTitle2 c-kkmdlQ-dYJjti-weight-regular c-kkmdlQ-dWajWX-structure-subTitle1 c-kkmdlQ-igUsxiu-css">Yogesh Shukla</span><span class="c-kkmdlQ c-kkmdlQ-fFohXj-structure-body2 c-kkmdlQ-dYJjti-weight-regular c-kkmdlQ-jrYTkR-structure-subTitle2 c-kkmdlQ-idmTVrC-css">January 10, 2025</span><div class="c-PJLV c-bXbWpx c-bXbWpx-bZJlhX-direction-column c-bXbWpx-iglWCJT-css"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="c-cZuCZG c-cZuCZG-gtZKQU-size-large c-cZuCZG-dmsdwv-rotate-up c-cZuCZG-ijkIlMj-css"></svg><span class="c-kkmdlQ c-kkmdlQ-fFohXj-structure-body2 c-kkmdlQ-dYJjti-weight-regular c-kkmdlQ-dWajWX-structure-body1 c-kkmdlQ-ilkNjku-css">I had mistakenly ordered the wrong strip of tablets and thought I’d have to go through a lot of hassle to return it, but the customer support made it super easy. They arranged a return pickup and my refund was processed in just 2 days.</span></div></div></div><div data-id="Testimonials-3" id="Testimonials-3" class="c-PJLV c-bXbWpx c-bXbWpx-bZJlhX-direction-column c-bXbWpx-joJbDg-align-center c-bXbWpx-idNcPHZ-css"><div class="c-PJLV c-bXbWpx c-bXbWpx-bZJlhX-direction-column c-bXbWpx-ilkBNdM-css"><span class="c-kkmdlQ c-kkmdlQ-jxPRpY-structure-subTitle2 c-kkmdlQ-dYJjti-weight-regular c-kkmdlQ-dWajWX-structure-subTitle1 c-kkmdlQ-igUsxiu-css">Anuj Kumar</span><span class="c-kkmdlQ c-kkmdlQ-fFohXj-structure-body2 c-kkmdlQ-dYJjti-weight-regular c-kkmdlQ-jrYTkR-structure-subTitle2 c-kkmdlQ-idmTVrC-css">March 12, 2025</span><div class="c-PJLV c-bXbWpx c-bXbWpx-bZJlhX-direction-column c-bXbWpx-iglWCJT-css"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="c-cZuCZG c-cZuCZG-gtZKQU-size-large c-cZuCZG-dmsdwv-rotate-up c-cZuCZG-ijkIlMj-css"></svg><span class="c-kkmdlQ c-kkmdlQ-fFohXj-structure-body2 c-kkmdlQ-dYJjti-weight-regular c-kkmdlQ-dWajWX-structure-body1 c-kkmdlQ-ilkNjku-css">PharmEasy is the best application for ordering medicines and lab tests. I have been using it for the last 5 years. The customer support is also good.</span></div></div></div><div data-id="Testimonials-4" id="Testimonials-4" class="c-PJLV c-bXbWpx c-bXbWpx-bZJlhX-direction-column c-bXbWpx-joJbDg-align-center c-bXbWpx-idNcPHZ-css"><div class="c-PJLV c-bXbWpx c-bXbWpx-bZJlhX-direction-column c-bXbWpx-ilkBNdM-css"><span class="c-kkmdlQ c-kkmdlQ-jxPRpY-structure-subTitle2 c-kkmdlQ-dYJjti-weight-regular c-kkmdlQ-dWajWX-structure-subTitle1 c-kkmdlQ-igUsxiu-css">Meha jain</span><span class="c-kkmdlQ c-kkmdlQ-fFohXj-structure-body2 c-kkmdlQ-dYJjti-weight-regular c-kkmdlQ-jrYTkR-structure-subTitle2 c-kkmdlQ-idmTVrC-css">April 3, 2025</span><div class="c-PJLV c-bXbWpx c-bXbWpx-bZJlhX-direction-column c-bXbWpx-iglWCJT-css"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="c-cZuCZG c-cZuCZG-gtZKQU-size-large c-cZuCZG-dmsdwv-rotate-up c-cZuCZG-ijkIlMj-css"></svg><span class="c-kkmdlQ c-kkmdlQ-fFohXj-structure-body2 c-kkmdlQ-dYJjti-weight-regular c-kkmdlQ-dWajWX-structure-body1 c-kkmdlQ-ilkNjku-css">Excellent app for medicines &amp; body check ups. Best part is that the app gives you the option to select from a range of Generic medicines manufactured by reputed firms which helps save a lot of money apart from giving so many options to choose from! Loved it.</span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div id="static_seo" class="c-PJLV c-bXbWpx c-bXbWpx-ihmxdyA-css"><div class="c-IkEYc c-IkEYc-ihcptlg-css"><div class="c-PJLV c-bXbWpx c-bXbWpx-bZJlhX-direction-column c-bXbWpx-igSIUcw-css"><div class="c-PJLV c-bXbWpx c-bXbWpx-lfylVv-direction-row c-bXbWpx-ijVxrOq-css"><span class="c-kkmdlQ c-kkmdlQ-jxPRpY-structure-subTitle2 c-kkmdlQ-jdOIsX-weight-semiBold c-kkmdlQ-icxpJtm-css">Top-Tests we cover<!-- -->: